Z||000000||Vlad||02-17-2001||06:12 PM||||Hello, <BR>After 7 month of ownership I finaly checked timing. And what do you think?  1 cil - 10, 4 cil - 10. <BR>According to the book and sticker, it has to be 10 degrees in awerage between 1 and 4 cilinder.<BR>So I set it to 5 degrees - 1 cil, and 5 degrees - 4 cilinder.<BR>Am I right?<P>Well...  My Fiero was making 15 mpg. Hope I solved this problem by setting timing.<BR>Do I have a reason for this hope... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> ...?||||reg||4
Z||000001||daved||02-17-2001||06:30 PM||||Er...no Vlad.<BR>Average of the SUM of the two.  ie if #1 was 12 and #4 was 10, you set it to 11.<BR>Also you did set it in "diagnostic mode" before adjusting the timing?<BR>Dave||||reg||1
Z||000002||Phil||02-17-2001||06:31 PM||||Put it back to 10* BTC. That is the correct figure. (10+10)/2 =10||||reg||1
Z||000003||Vlad||02-17-2001||06:39 PM||||Hall of shame.......((<P>Of course you're guys right. <BR>I feel stupid...(<P>The interesting point is that I know what the average is very well since I'm a programmer.... <P>How could I do that....||||reg||1
Z||000004||Jules||02-17-2001||06:45 PM||||<BR>Well...  My Fiero was making 15 mpg. Hope I solved this problem by setting timing.<BR>Do I have a reason for this hope...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><BR>had my timing adjusted...upped my mpg from 12 to 28mpg!!! definitely worth it!<P>||||reg||1
Z||000005||Vlad||02-17-2001||07:22 PM||||Sh***t.....<P>Now I don't have a timing light so I had to go back by memory. <P>Ok....I turned it back as it was and testdrove the car. It was pinging like creasy... <BR>However, once I put it close to the new position (with 5 degree), the car was running wery well. <BR>My guess is that I didn't see the reading corectly in the beginning. I mean the base timing before adjustment was more than 10. <BR>I was watching from above the balancer so even though the dot seemed to be on 10 was way below 10 degrees mark.<P>Anyway, I guess I should get the timing light again and recheck the timing.<BR>But how do you guys can see the mark properly? I coulnd't.....((||||reg||1
Z||000006||Phil||02-17-2001||08:50 PM||||Clean the damper and either put paint or chalk on the mark.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000007||Vlad||02-17-2001||09:03 PM||||Ok<BR>That's it I guess........<P>Got timing light, set timing to 10 in diag. mode. <P>The car drives fine, no pinging, great performance.<P>Everybody thanks for help.<P>||||reg||1
